Kompas studio photo v1. Editorial visual review approved.
Original SHA-256: 443cccb0c0d4c3316280618b83acd7520e07d2cd95a266bcb17d496e70e2528b
Three believable practice materials on a real shelf, a small wood sample, simple music sticks and a thin closed study folio. Neutral sensibility and ordinary daylight. Make one original ultra-realistic live editorial studio photograph for the independent magazine Kompas. Wide landscape about 1.9:1, central subject inside the middle 75% for a consistent crop; clear plausible optics and readable shadow detail. Real controlled directional daylight, neutral-warm color, tactile ordinary materials, one purposeful subject and an interesting but restrained sense of depth. Photographic, no layout or decorative graphics. No people, faces, hands, silhouettes, visible lettering, numbers, logos, neon, fake interface or watermarks.
